    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūshoka kwa ng'wa Seeba",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batogwa, ī nyalūba yenīyī ya kabīlī lūūlū nalīng'wandīkīla. Ū mu jose būbīlī wajo nalīng'wizūkīja, nguno natogilwe ng'wīnje a mahane hane ū mu maganiko ging'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Natogilwe muyizūkwe ī mihayo īyo yamala kūhayiwa na bahangi beela; na a malange ga ng'wa Seeba na Nkomooji wise, ayo mukinhwa na a batūng'wa abo mukatūmīlwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī soolo ya mhayo managi gīkī, ū kū shikū ja kū būkalīkījo bakwilonga badalahīja ba kwikala bakūsondagūlaga, kūnū būlondeela mihayo ya kwikūmva kwabo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na kūhaya gīkī, “Hama kūlī halī lūūlū ū kwisagīja kwa kūshoka kwakwe? Nguno kūfuma kūko bachīla a bakūlūgenji bise, pyī ī mihayo ītaalī gīt'ūmo īlī na kale kwīngīīla kū wandījo wa kūseeng'wa kwayo!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakwijimīījaga bo makaala ī gīkī, ī ligūlū līlīho kūfuma kale kūlwa mhayo go ng'wa Mulungu; nī sī īkabeejiwa mu minzī, yūbumbūka kūfuma mu minzī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ī sī ya makanza gene īkatubījiwa minzī, yūkenaagūlwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ūmo īlī nū kwigūlū lya haha nī sī; nasho shilīho kūlwa mhayo hū gwenūyo dūhū, shibīkilwe kūlwa kūkenaagūlwa na moto ū mu lūshikū lo kūlamulwa na kūyagajiwa kwa banhū abo batantogilwe Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike a bing'we batogwa yaya ū kūgūjimīīlwa ū mhayo ūyū, gīkī ū lūshikū ū lūmò ū kūlī Seeba lūlī gītī myaka shihūmbī, nī myaka shihūmbī īlī gītī lūshikū lūmò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Seeba atī ndīzu ū kūshikīlīja ū kwisagīja kwakwe, gīt'ūmo bangī bakwiganikīlaga gīkī wadīlile; alīyo alī na wiyūmīlīja kūlwa nguno ying'we. Ū wei atatogilwe nūūlū ūmò ayagale, atogilwe pye bagalūke booye ī shibi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū lūshikū lo ng'wa Seeba lūkwiza mu shībya gītī ng'wibi, ū mu lūshikū lwenūlo ī ligūlū līkwīnjiwa ho mu shilundumo shitaale; ī shiseeng'wa shamo shikwabiwa na moto shishile, pyī nī sī nī milīmo ī yose īyo īlīmo īkwabiwa īshile ho! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūūlū īkī ī shikolo shenīshi shikwabiwa gīko, a bing'we shiigelile mubize banhū ba nhūngwa ja mbika kī ū mu wela, nū mu kūnkūja ū Mulungu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū kwiza kwa lūshikū lo ng'wa Mulungu ūlo mulūlindīīlile kūtūdīlaga; ū mu lūshikū lwenūlo ī ligūlū līkūbaka moto līshile ho, nī shiseeng'wa ī shingī shaabe! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūmo kūlī kwisagīja kwakwe, a bise tūlindīīlile igūlū ipya na sī mhya, ūmo būkūbiza būlīmo būtūngīlīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū batogwa īkī ng'wīlindīīlile ī mihayo yenīyī, komeelagi mubize mutī na būbi nūūlū shilingo ū kūlī Mulungu, musangwe mulī mu mhola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama ū wiyūmīlīja bo ng'wa Seeba wise Yesu Kilisito, būbalagi gīkī būlī būpīji; gīt'ūmo na ndūgū wise Paulo wamalile kūng'wandīkīla kūlwa witegeleja bokwe ūbo winhwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo pyī ū mu nyalūba jakwe akwīhayaga ī mihayo yenīyī; na ng'hana yīngī īyo īlīmo milambu ū kwīyitegeleja. Nose abo batamanile na a balelengetu bakwīchaamyaga, gīt'ūmo bakīītīlaga dūhū nū mu shandīkwa ī shingī; alīyo ū mu gīko bagwikenaagūlaga boi benekīlī! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū badūgū, īkī ng'wīmanile na kale ī mihayo yenīyī, ilang'hanagi mutizūhūbiwa na būshitiigwa bo banhū abo bahūbīkile, nose mutajiwe ng'wīnge ū mu kūhandatīla kwing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo kūlagi ū mu shigongo sha ng'wa Seeba na Mpīja wise Yesu Kilisito, pyī nū mu witegeleja. Ikūjo lībize kūlī we kwandīja haha kūshisha shiku jose. Alichene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.3.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
